  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c4422124858a8e0",
      "translationZh": "我之前读到，做张量并行时不应该使用不匹配的 PCIe 配置，所以我把主板从 MSI PRO-X670-P-WIFI 升级到了 Asus ProArt X870E-Creator WIFI。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "491f62190fd5fba0",
      "translationZh": "旧主板上的配置是 gen4 x16 和 gen4 x4。新主板上，两张 AMD R9700 显卡都使用 gen5 x8。根据文档，新旧两块主板的这些插槽都直接连接到 CPU。两套配置下 P2P 都能正常工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84b84f0eeb01a2e2",
      "translationZh": "我在升级前后使用 guidellm 做了一些基准测试，在相同设置下，似乎有了一些提升：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26b6467d1440f53b",
      "translationZh": "并发数 指标 旧配置 新配置 提升",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce1b5e10fd59e758",
      "translationZh": "1 TPOT 毫秒 15.96 13.53 +15.2%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "296fae6be203ca52",
      "translationZh": "1 延迟 s 51.09 43.31 +15.2%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e35826f982bd79e8",
      "translationZh": "2 首词元生成时间（毫秒）13957.38 8976.44 +35.7%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e5fd2f2030b32b8",
      "translationZh": "2 TPOT 毫秒 20.61 17.86 +13.3%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a315c17de77722a3",
      "translationZh": "2 延迟 s 65.94 57.14 +13.4%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63e634856d43522e",
      "translationZh": "4 首个词元延迟 毫秒 21001.50 13566.46 +35.4%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e29c958c8f6eff82",
      "translationZh": "4 TPOT 毫秒 29.93 24.24 +19.0%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0731c1f619eb9981",
      "translationZh": "4 延迟 s 95.77 77.57 +19.0%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a416136fdebcd763",
      "translationZh": "我还没决定这次升级是否值得花这些钱和时间，因为我对旧主板的性能已经相当满意了，不过结果看起来确实好了一点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "881aaf6c650b0107",
      "translationZh": "所以，如果你正计划组装一台 AMD 双 GPU AI 主机，并且想知道 PCIe 速度对张量并行是否有影响，这里又多了一个数据点 :)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b66cc7c845a9b25",
      "translationZh": "我使用的是 stilldeadcode/vllm-radiance:0.7.4 和 Qwen 3.8 27B fp8，kv 设置为 auto（fp16）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c3ef351cfb2a1a0",
      "translationZh": "两块 GPU 都是 Gigabyte AI PRO R9700 AI TOP 32G。CPU 为 9950X。内存为 64 GB DDR5 6000。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "tensor parallelism",
      "briefZh": "张量并行",
      "explanationZh": "将模型的张量计算拆分到多个 GPU 上共同执行的并行方式。"
    },
    {
      "term": "PCIe",
      "briefZh": "高速扩展总线",
      "explanationZh": "连接显卡等设备与处理器的总线标准，代际和通道数量会影响传输带宽。"
    },
    {
      "term": "P2P",
      "briefZh": "点对点通信",
      "explanationZh": "此处指 GPU 之间直接传输数据的能力。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Latency",
      "briefZh": "延迟",
      "explanationZh": "请求从开始到完成所需的时间，此处以秒为单位。"
    },
    {
      "term": "fp8",
      "briefZh": "八位浮点",
      "explanationZh": "一种使用 8 位表示数值的浮点格式，文中用于描述模型的数值精度。"
    },
    {
      "term": "fp16",
      "briefZh": "半精度浮点",
      "explanationZh": "一种使用 16 位表示数值的浮点格式，文中指 kv 采用的数值精度。"
    },
    {
      "term": "TTFT",
      "briefZh": "首个词元延迟",
      "explanationZh": "从发出请求到收到首个输出词元所需的时间。"
    },
    {
      "term": "ms",
      "briefZh": "毫秒",
      "explanationZh": "时间单位，表示千分之一秒。"
    },
    {
      "term": "TTFT ms",
      "briefZh": "毫秒级延迟指标",
      "explanationZh": "表示以毫秒为单位记录的首个词元延迟。"
    },
    {
      "term": "TPOT",
      "briefZh": "每令牌耗时",
      "explanationZh": "通常指每个输出令牌的生成耗时（Time Per Output Token）。"
    },
    {
      "term": "TPOT ms",
      "briefZh": "词元耗时指标",
      "explanationZh": "表示以毫秒为单位报告每个输出词元的生成耗时。"
    }
  ],
